<div class="side-by-side">
  <h2>The Challenge</h2>
  <p>
    Intel Inspires is one of the largest scholastic esports events. With an
    eight-month tournament series culminating in a live championship, it needed
    a cohesive identity that matched its scale. Beyond competition, the event
    had to drive brand engagement, career development, and lead generation for
    Intel and partners.
  </p>
</div>

