<h2>The Solution</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Unified Identity for Scholastic Esports</p>
  <p>
    I led creative direction across all eight months. From social promos to
    event signage, we adapted Intel’s corporate branding
    into a true esports identity, modular enough to integrate partner brands
    like ASUS, CDW, and SHI while maintaining a unified and modern design system
    for screens of all sizes.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Pathway to Success</p>
  <p>
    We built Intel Inspires to be a structured pathway for high school and
    college players to compete, network, and gain visibility from the start. We
    designed the summit to not only showcase top talent but also to educate and
    connect students with industry professionals and recruiters.
  </p>
</div>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Competition & Career Development</p>
  <p>
    With a three-day LAN championship and industry summit, we delivered a dual
    experience—high-energy esports alongside thought leadership panels and
    networking sessions, so players and educators could leave with meaningful
    insights and career opportunities.
  </p>
</div>
